    23	#   --stage all. Run B: convergence_v2.py --gate --site pod on the two gate cells, then the main run with the four gate
    24	#   records (two Mac records from the bundle, two from this pod). Run B is refused before any marker unless both Mac gate
    25	#   records in the bundle pass and bind to EXPECT (their binding includes the commit).
    26	# - After RUN OK every output directory is verified: each inventoried record exists with its hash, and every file in the
    27	#   directory (except inventory.json, *.lock, *.tmp) is inventoried.
