    29	# mid-step (the watchdog). An EXIT/INT/TERM trap pulls what exists (only if the run started), deletes the pod and verifies
    30	# it. Spend (r16): the record is the account balance difference (podctl.py spend NAME, at least an hour after the watchdog
    31	# ends); this launcher prints only estimates. One launch per NAME at a time (NAME.launchlock; the watchdog releases it).
    32	# Usage: followup2_pod.sh <A|B> <code_tgz> <bundle_tgz> <tag> <cap_usd> <local_out>   (no spaces in paths)
